    "只解密插件 [MITM] 列出的主机，仅支持 HTTP/1.1。脚本和插件里的分流规则暂不生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only hosts listed under a plugin's [MITM] are decrypted, over HTTP/1.1 only. Scripts and routing rules in plugins don't take effect yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以解密 MITM 主机列表中的 HTTPS 流量。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS traffic to hosts in the MITM list can be decrypted."
