    "导入新节点会替换当前节点。多节点、订阅和策略组会在内核支持后开放。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importing a new node replaces the current one. Multiple nodes, subscriptions and policy groups will open up once the core supports them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
