          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "延迟为到服务器端口的 TCP 连接时间；Hysteria2、TUIC 走 UDP，不在此测量。连接中切换节点会自动重连。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delay is the TCP connect time to the server port; Hysteria2 and TUIC use UDP and are not measured here. Switching nodes while connected reconnects automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开发者模式": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Developer Mode"
